      <div class="prose about-copy-body">
        <p class="lead">I’m Sean Song—an engineer, product builder, and lifelong student of the systems hiding underneath everyday tools.</p>
        <p>I started close to the metal: codecs, embedded systems, and the kind of work where a single wrong bit can ruin the whole result. Today I build products with AI and write about the strange continuity between those worlds.</p>
        <p>seanslab is where I follow technical constraints into history, business, culture, and human behavior. The pieces are long because the interesting part is usually one layer deeper than the obvious answer.</p>
        <p>If something here starts a useful argument, write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
